# 物品开发（Forge 1.14.4）

## Decision: 物品类型选择

```
IF 只是手持物品（无特殊行为）
  → Item

IF 剑（影响攻击伤害、攻击速度）
  → SwordItem

IF 挖掘工具（影响挖掘速度、挖掘等级）
  → PickaxeItem / AxeItem / ShovelItem / HoeItem

IF 盔甲（影响护甲值、韧性）
  → ArmorItem + IArmorMaterial

IF 可食用
  → Item + .food() + Food.Builder

IF 需要附魔
  → Enchantment + IForgeEntityEquipmentSlot
```

## Item.Properties

```java
new Item.Properties()
    .maxStackSize(64)                    // 最大堆叠数
    .maxDamage(250)                      // 最大耐久（与 maxStackSize 互斥）
    .group(ItemGroup.BUILDING_BLOCKS)   // 创造模式标签
    .containerItem(Items.BUCKET)         // 容器物品（如桶装牛奶）
    .rarity(Rarity.RARE)                 // 稀有度（影响名称颜色）
    .burnTime(100)                       // 燃烧时间（燃料）
    .saturation(0)                       // 饱和度（食物）
```

## Item 基础示例

```java
public class MyItem extends Item {
    public MyItem() {
        super(new Item.Properties()
            .maxStackSize(64)
            .group(ItemGroup.MISC)
        );
    }

    // 右键使用
    @Override
    public ActionResult<ItemStack> onItemRightClick(World world, PlayerEntity player, Hand hand) {
        player.sendMessage(new StringTextComponent("Hello!"), player.getUniqueID());
        return ActionResult.resultSuccess(player.getHeldItem(hand));
    }
}

// 注册
@SubscribeEvent
public static void onItemsRegistry(final RegistryEvent.Register<Item> event) {
    event.getRegistry().register(
        new MyItem().setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "my_item"))
    );
}
```

## 工具层级 ITier

```java
public enum MyTier implements ITier {
    COPPER(3,       // harvestLevel
            500,    // maxUses
            6.0f,   // efficiency
            2.0f,   // attackDamage
            15,     // enchantability
            () -> Ingredient.fromItems(Items.DIAMOND));

    private final int harvestLevel;
    private final int maxUses;
    private final float efficiency;
    private final float attackDamage;
    private final int enchantability;
    private final Ingredient repairMaterial;

    MyTier(int harvestLevel, int maxUses, float efficiency, float attackDamage, int enchantability, Supplier<Ingredient> repairMaterial) {
        this.harvestLevel = harvestLevel;
        this.maxUses = maxUses;
        this.efficiency = efficiency;
        this.attackDamage = attackDamage;
        this.enchantability = enchantability;
        this.repairMaterial = repairMaterial;
    }

    @Override public int getHarvestLevel() { return harvestLevel; }
    @Override public float getEfficiency() { return efficiency; }
    @Override public float getAttackDamage() { return attackDamage; }
    @Override public int getEnchantability() { return enchantability; }
    @Override public Ingredient getRepairMaterial() { return repairMaterial; }
}
```

## 剑 SwordItem

```java
// 参数顺序：(Tier, float attackDamage, float attackSpeed, Item.Properties)
